;
; How Tideturn files one record of its update trail in MYRA
; (tideturn_rules.h TR3): its number, the version it is about (major,
; minor and patch, 0..999 each), whether its signatures verified (1) or
; not (0), its outcome (tideturn_model.h TIDETURN_CHECKED ..
; TIDETURN_DECLINED) and when, in ms since 1970 by zxvd's clock.
^ZXTIDE(seq:i9) = major:i3! ^ minor:i3! ^ patch:i3! ^ signed:i1! ^ outcome:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
